{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像被诱惑了一样，我犹犹豫豫地把嘴唇贴了过去。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我到底在做什么啊。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在她睡觉的时候，要去……要去亲吻什么的。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把脸挪开，晃了晃头。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后又把手放在樱乃的肩上慢慢地摇晃。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……樱乃，起来了」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……呜……」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3870", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃……樱乃……」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯……？」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3871", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "朦胧的眼神。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "慢慢地凝聚出了焦点。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥……哥哥？」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3872", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早啊，樱乃」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，早啊」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3873", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀？没到早上」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3874", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥等一下，\\n　我想着你就算吃了晚饭也可以再吃点，就做了点小吃……」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「哥哥等一下，　我想着你就算吃了晚饭也可以再吃点，就做了点小吃……」", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3875", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你在桌子上睡着了」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，好像是这样的」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3876", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也发生了很多事情，也许是累着了」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3877", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「睡觉的话，还是得回到房间里躺着睡，\\n　不然可消除不了疲劳」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "「睡觉的话，还是得回到房间里躺着睡，　不然可消除不了疲劳」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。要是能好好地睡下去就好了」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3878", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，就先回房间——」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「那么，就先回房间——」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我不是这个意思」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3879", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是继续睡下去，也许接吻呀，公主抱之类的，\\n　哥哥就都会对我做了」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "「要是继续睡下去，也许接吻呀，公主抱之类的，　哥哥就都会对我做了」", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3880", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃用含有些许期待的目光看向我。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "樱乃用含有些许期待的目光看向我。", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哪边都没有」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜……哥哥，好无情」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3881", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一瞬间就消沉了。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉，我做了件坏事啊……", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像让你等了好久，那就给你点特别的，来」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我示意她靠过来。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3882", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃疑惑地歪了歪小脑袋，但还是来到我的面前。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概这样吧」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻把手放在她头上，缓缓地抚摸。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之后一段时间，我就抚摸着樱乃的头发。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "双方也没有必要再说些什么。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3883", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃眯起眼睛露出一副很舒服的表情。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃，你喜欢被摸头发吗？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。我喜欢哥哥摸我的头发」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3884", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3885", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "稍微思考了一会后，樱乃解开了发带。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很痛吗？」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是的」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3886", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "将两侧的发带完全解开后，\\n她的头发轻飘飘地散开。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": "将两侧的发带完全解开后，她的头发轻飘飘地散开。", "plain_idx": 406, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样的话，就能让哥哥充分地抚摸了」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3887", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来，尽情来吧」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3888", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……感觉有些不一样了啊」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜……不可以吗？」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3889", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 165, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不是不行。那我摸了哦」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 166, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯♪」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk3890", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
